    "Name": "Nixe NX-Prime",
    "Details": "The Prime configuration of the Nixe, a quad ProtoMech the Society built to find the practical limits of what a ProtoMech could mount, carries an Improved Heavy Large Laser as its main gun. The high damage output of this heavy laser makes it very capable of opening holes in enemy armor for allies to exploit, so the configuration is usually used to set up devastating ambushes. As a slow unit, it is mostly found on prepared battlefields, such as around fixed facilities.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.99</color></b>",
